title: StartDay4
position: -125,-487
---
<<set $daysPassed = 741>>
<<declare $day4Route = "">>
<<if $catLikesYou > $catDislikesYou * 1.5>>
    <<set $day4Route = "true">>
<<elseif $catLikesYou > $catDislikesYou>>
    <<set $day4Route = "good">>
<<else>>
    <<set $day4Route = "bad">>
<<endif>>
<<play_sound AlarmClock>>
<<play_music MainTheme>>
I jolt awake gasping, hands braced against the cryopod lid like I'm trying to stop it from closing.
I blink. The ship is intact. I'm intact.
Day {$daysPassed}.
I lie here for a bit, waiting for the dream to finish draining out.
<<show_ui ClickToInteract>>
<<show MonitorOffDay4>>
===

title: OnClickedMonitorDay4
position: -128,-338
---
<<hide_all_ui_objects>>
<<show MonitorOn>>
Then, I power on the monitor.
The comms buffer loads slowly. HQ digest, mission parameters, the usual.
<<if $day4Route == "true">>
    <<jump OnClickedMonitorDay4_True>>
<<elseif $day4Route == "good">>
    <<jump OnClickedMonitorDay4_Good>>
<<else>>
    <<jump OnClickedMonitorDay4_Bad>>
<<endif>>
===

title: OnClickedMonitorDay4_True
position: -128,-200
---
<<play_sound Glitch 0.25>>
The comms buffer isn't empty. It's full. Packets stacked on top of each other, all on {$catName}'s frequency. The translator struggles to keep up.
<<speed 0.4>>
<<play_sound RobotHey 0.25>>
"HEY" <i>[3 DAYS AGO]</i>
"PLEASE ANSWER" <i>[2 DAYS AGO]</i>
"THEY KNOW" <i>[2 DAYS AGO]</i>
<<play_sound RobotHey 0.25>>
"HEY" <i>[2 DAYS AGO]</i>
"PLEASE WAKE UP" <i>[2 DAYS AGO]</i>
<<speed 1>>
My hands are shaking.
    -> (answer immediately)
        <<jump CallCatDay4_True>>
===

title: OnClickedMonitorDay4_Good
position: -128,-60
---
Then, at the bottom, a single packet on {$catName}'s frequency. The translator renders it immediately.
<<play_sound Glitch 0.25>>
<<speed 0.4>>
<<play_sound RobotHey 0.25>>
"HEY" <i>[3 DAYS AGO]</i>
<<speed 1>>
One word. After everything.
    -> (answer)
        <<jump CallCatDay4_Good>>
    -> (stare at it for a while)
        I sit with that single word for longer than I should. Three letters. No context. No apology. No explanation.
        Just... hey.
            -> (answer)
                <<jump CallCatDay4_Good>>
===

title: OnClickedMonitorDay4_Bad
position: -128,80
---
Then, at the bottom, a single packet on {$catName}'s frequency. The translator renders it immediately.
<<play_sound Glitch 0.25>>
<<speed 0.4>>
<<play_sound RobotStillHere 0.25>>
"HEY" <i>[3 DAYS AGO]</i>
<<speed 1>>
One word. I'm not sure what I expected.
    -> (answer)
        <<jump CallCatDay4_Bad>>
    -> (stare at it for a while)
        Three letters. No warmth. No urgency. Just a signal sent out of habit, or maybe obligation.
            -> (answer)
                <<jump CallCatDay4_Bad>>
===

title: CallCatDay4_True
position: 422,100
---
<<hide_all_objects>>
<<hide_all_ui_objects>>
<<show PCRoom>>
<<show MonitorSilhouette>>
<<show_character Cat Obscure right>>
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
I open the channel. The static clears almost instantly. {$catName} is already there, pressed close to the screen.
<<play_music CatTheme 0.5>>
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
{$catName}: You awake. You finally awake.
{$catName}: I been calling and calling. I thought maybe you not come back this time.
    -> I'm here. What's happening?
        <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        {$catName}: Okay. Okay. I tell you everything.
    -> I saw the messages. All of them.
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: Then you know. Something bad is happening.
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: {$catThinksPlayerNameIs}... my people found out. About us. About everything.
{$catName}: Father confronted me. He say I betrayed them. That I am just like... like the human who came before.
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: They want to shut down my transmitter. Cut me off from everything outside our planet.
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: If they do that... I never talk to anyone again. Not you. Not anyone.
    -> What are you going to do?
        <<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
        {$catName}: I... I have plan. But it depend on you.
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: There is planet. Near the star you going to. Small one. Warm. Has air, has water.
{$catName}: My people know about it. They call it "the quiet place." Nobody use it. Nobody go there.
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: I can take small ship. Leave before they lock me down. Meet you there.
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: But if I do this... I never go home. My father, my people... I lose them.
{$catName}: And you... you would have to leave your mission. Leave Earth behind. For real.
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
The words hang in the recycled air. Leave everything. For someone I've only ever seen through static and glass.
But when I think about it... what am I leaving? A mission nobody reads the reports for. A planet full of people who didn't notice when I left. A ship that hums but never answers back.
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: I know it is much to ask. I know we only talk through screen. I know I am not even... same kind as you.
{$catName}: But you are only person who ever made me feel like I get to choose who I am.
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: And I think... maybe I do the same for you?
    -> You do.
        <<positive_indicator Cat>>
        <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
        <<set $posSelfPerception += 1>>
        <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
        {$catName}: Then... you come? You meet me there?
            -> (set course for the quiet planet)
                <<jump TrueEnd>>
            -> I can't. I'm sorry.
                <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
                {$catName}: ...I understand. I hoped, but... I understand.
                <<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
                <<jump CatConvoDay4_GoodPath_Farewell>>
    -> I don't know if I can do this.
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: That okay. I not ask you to decide now. But I have to go soon. Before they find me.
            -> Then go. I'll find you.
                <<positive_indicator Cat>>
                <<set $catLikesYou += 1>>
                <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
                {$catName}: You mean it?
                    -> Yeah. I mean it.
                <<jump TrueEnd>>
            -> I can't leave everything behind.
                <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
                {$catName}: ...Okay. Then this is maybe last time.
                <<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
                <<jump CatConvoDay4_GoodPath_Farewell>>
===

title: CallCatDay4_Good
position: 422,300
---
<<hide_all_objects>>
<<hide_all_ui_objects>>
<<show PCRoom>>
<<show MonitorSilhouette>>
<<show_character Cat Obscure right>>
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
I open the channel. The static clears faster this time, like the connection remembers us.
<<play_music CatTheme 0.5>>
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
{$catName}: ...Hey.
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
Neither of us speaks for a moment. The weight of last time sits between us like a wall we built without meaning to.
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: I was not sure you would answer. After what I tell you.
{$catName}: About the human. The one on my planet. About... everything.
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: I want you to know... I not blame you.
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: I been thinking. About us. About what this is.
{$catName}: We come from different world. Different body. Different language. Different everything.
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: But somehow... we understand each other. More than people who live next to us our whole life.
{$catName}: Is that not strange?
    -> It is what it is.
        <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        {$catName}: Mm. Maybe that enough.
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: {$catThinksPlayerNameIs}... I want tell you something. My people are close to finding out about us.
{$catName}: My father... he suspicious. He ask question. He watch me more careful now.
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: I think soon I will not be able to call anymore. They will lock my transmitter.
{$catName}: So this might be... last time.
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
The words land like a slow impact. I knew this was coming. Maybe I always knew.
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: But before I go... can we do one thing?
{$catName}: The star. The one you flying toward. The one with the dark spot in center.
{$catName}: I can see it too. From my planet. We call it "the eye that never close."
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: Can we... look at it together? Right now? At same time?
    -> (look at the star)
        <<jump CatConvoDay4_GoodPath_Farewell>>
===

title: CatConvoDay4_GoodPath_Farewell
position: 647,450
---
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
<<hide_all_objects>>
<<show Stars>>
<<show Sitting>>
I move to the viewport and find the star. It's there, as always. The dark spot in its center like a pupil staring back.
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: You see it?
    -> I see it.
{$catName}: Same star. Same light. Different eyes.
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: {$catThinksPlayerNameIs}... I am different because of you. I want you to know that.
{$catName}: Before you, I was someone my father made. Someone my people shaped. I did not know where they ended and I began.
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: Now I know. Because you showed me what it look like to choose. Even when choice is scary.
    -> You changed me too.
        <<set $posSelfPerception += 1>>
        <<show_character Cat Happy right>>
        {$catName}: Then we both woke up. At same time. Across all that dark.
    -> I hope you'll be okay.
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: I will try. That is all anyone can do.
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: I will remember you. Always. Even if they take the transmitter. Even if they take everything.
{$catName}: You are written in me now. Like word I can never unlearn.
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: Goodbye, {$catThinksPlayerNameIs}.
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
<<hide_all_characters>>
<<play_sound Glitch 0.25>>
<<hide MonitorSilhouette>>
The screen goes dark. Not with a crash, not with static. Just a slow fade, like someone gently closing their eyes.
<<jump GoodEnd>>
===

title: CallCatDay4_Bad
position: 422,600
---
<<hide_all_objects>>
<<hide_all_ui_objects>>
<<show PCRoom>>
<<show MonitorSilhouette>>
<<show_character Cat Obscure right>>
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
I open the channel. The static takes its time clearing. Like even the connection has given up trying.
<<play_music CatTheme 0.5>>
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
{$catName}: ...Hey.
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
Neither of us speaks. The silence doesn't feel heavy anymore. It just feels empty.
<<start_voice_blip Cat>>
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: So. Here we are.
{$catName}: I not really know why I call. Maybe habit. Maybe hope.
<<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
{$catName}: But I look at you through screen and I think... we never really knew each other. Did we?
    -> We tried.
        <<show_character Cat Sad right>>
        {$catName}: Did we? Or did we just... talk at each other? Through the static?
    -> Maybe not.
        <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        {$catName}: At least you honest about it.
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: My people going to shut down my transmitter soon. They know I been talking to someone.
{$catName}: Father say it for my own good. Maybe he right.
<<show_character Cat Sad right>>
{$catName}: I thought talking to you would help me grow. Make me more... me.
{$catName}: But I just feel small again. Like I was before.
    -> I'm sorry things turned out this way.
        <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        {$catName}: ...Yeah. Me too.
    -> ...
        <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
        {$catName}: Silence. That feel right. For us.
<<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
{$catName}: Goodbye, {$catThinksPlayerNameIs}. Take care of yourself.
<<stop_voice_blip Cat>>
<<hide_all_characters>>
<<play_sound Glitch 0.25>>
<<hide MonitorSilhouette>>
The screen cuts to black. No static. No lingering glow. Just off.
<<jump BadEnd>>
===
